    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/752a865a0019d72b5114a84a26faf0de.poster.avif?t=1752735154\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/752a865a0019d72b5114a84a26faf0de.webm?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/752a865a0019d72b5114a84a26faf0de.mp4?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fully Modifiable World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In\u00a0<i>Evospace</i>, you are free to shape the world however you like. Dig, build, terraform \u2014 every block can be moved, and every inch of the world is under your control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Safe, but Not Easy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no enemies or deadly threats \u2014 just you and endless possibilities for building. But the path to a highly efficient factory is full of engineering challenges and logistical puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design complex production chains with hundreds of machines and technologies. Manage the flow of items, fluids, electricity, heat, and kinetic energy. Build logic circuits, configure blocks with controllers, create intelligent networks, and integrate everything into one cohesive factory system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chemistry, Metallurgy, and Fuel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master raw material processing \u2014 from basic ores to refined metals and advanced alloys. Use chemical processes to produce fuels, acids, solvents, and components for complex recipes. Control production chains with attention to pressure, temperature, and chemical reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/017ea67447c72b0ce55ab294379dd266.poster.avif?t=1752735154\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/017ea67447c72b0ce55ab294379dd266.webm?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/017ea67447c72b0ce55ab294379dd266.mp4?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Energy: From Coal to Uranium</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the right energy sources for your factory \u2014 coal burners, bioreactors, solar panels, steam turbines, or nuclear reactors. Proper energy distribution is key to maintaining a stable and efficient system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Circuits and High-Tech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress from mechanical machines to electronics, digital logic, fusion reactors, and teleportation technology. Create microchips, computers, and automated controllers. Unlock increasingly powerful automation tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hundreds of Technologies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock hundreds of technologies through the research tree. New resources, machines, materials, and upgrades will become available step by step as your factory evolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/565e244f62eba709c9e34c957969e6b8.poster.avif?t=1752735154\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/565e244f62eba709c9e34c957969e6b8.webm?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/565e244f62eba709c9e34c957969e6b8.mp4?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/752a865a0019d72b5114a84a26faf0de.poster.avif?t=1752735154\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/752a865a0019d72b5114a84a26faf0de.webm?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/752a865a0019d72b5114a84a26faf0de.mp4?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fully Modifiable World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In\u00a0<i>Evospace</i>, you are free to shape the world however you like. Dig, build, terraform \u2014 every block can be moved, and every inch of the world is under your control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Safe, but Not Easy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no enemies or deadly threats \u2014 just you and endless possibilities for building. But the path to a highly efficient factory is full of engineering challenges and logistical puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deep Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design complex production chains with hundreds of machines and technologies. Manage the flow of items, fluids, electricity, heat, and kinetic energy. Build logic circuits, configure blocks with controllers, create intelligent networks, and integrate everything into one cohesive factory system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chemistry, Metallurgy, and Fuel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master raw material processing \u2014 from basic ores to refined metals and advanced alloys. Use chemical processes to produce fuels, acids, solvents, and components for complex recipes. Control production chains with attention to pressure, temperature, and chemical reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/017ea67447c72b0ce55ab294379dd266.poster.avif?t=1752735154\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/017ea67447c72b0ce55ab294379dd266.webm?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/017ea67447c72b0ce55ab294379dd266.mp4?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Energy: From Coal to Uranium</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the right energy sources for your factory \u2014 coal burners, bioreactors, solar panels, steam turbines, or nuclear reactors. Proper energy distribution is key to maintaining a stable and efficient system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Circuits and High-Tech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress from mechanical machines to electronics, digital logic, fusion reactors, and teleportation technology. Create microchips, computers, and automated controllers. Unlock increasingly powerful automation tools.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hundreds of Technologies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock hundreds of technologies through the research tree. New resources, machines, materials, and upgrades will become available step by step as your factory evolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/565e244f62eba709c9e34c957969e6b8.poster.avif?t=1752735154\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/565e244f62eba709c9e34c957969e6b8.webm?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1013540/extras/565e244f62eba709c9e34c957969e6b8.mp4?t=1752735154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
